## First run

[% if kind == 'service' and container_image %]
```sh
docker run -d --name [[ project_name ]] -p 127.0.0.1:[[ port ]]:[[ port ]] [[ image ]]:latest
curl http://127.0.0.1:[[ port ]][[ health_path ]]      # {"status":"ok"}
docker exec [[ project_name ]] [[ project_name ]] config   # the effective configuration
```
[% elif kind == 'web' and container_image %]
```sh
docker run -d --name [[ project_name ]] -p 127.0.0.1:[[ port ]]:[[ port ]] [[ image ]]:latest
curl http://127.0.0.1:[[ port ]]/config.json         # the run-time configuration
```

Open <http://127.0.0.1:[[ port ]]/>: the home page shows the version and the API base URL.
[% elif kind == 'web' %]
Build it as [Contributing](Contributing) shows, then serve `dist/` with a web server that answers `index.html` for any path that is not a file.
[% elif has_cli %]
```sh
[[ project_name ]] --help
[[ project_name ]] config      # the effective configuration, and where each value came from
```
[% else %]
```[[ layer.code_lang ]]
[[ layer.import_snippet ]]
```
[% endif %]

